@startuml
title Payment — riêng từng Order
[*] --> PENDING : tạo cùng Order
PENDING --> SUCCEEDED : sandbox Success / COD thu đủ Order
PENDING --> FAILED : sandbox Failed
FAILED --> PENDING : Customer thử lại trước khi Order hết hạn
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Order hết hạn/hủy trước thu
CANCELLED --> SUCCEEDED : provider xác nhận Success muộn
SUCCEEDED --> REFUND_PENDING : Order hủy hoặc callback muộn
REFUND_PENDING --> REFUNDED : hoàn mock thành công
REFUND_PENDING --> REFUND_FAILED : hoàn lỗi
REFUND_FAILED --> REFUND_PENDING : retry cùng operation ID
@enduml
